                                "sense_id": "c7a6eb0c-9db4-31ba-ab41-04cf1260181a",
                                "text": "Tom. So, did you mark the dulness of her parting now?\nAlon. What dulness? Thou art so exceptious still."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b4038e5-c6fa-444d-8e7c-b3d96b88db0e",
                                "sense_id": "c7a6eb0c-9db4-31ba-ab41-04cf1260181a",
                                "text": "And lastly, how shall many seeming Clashings, and dark Passages in Sacred History and Chronology be placed in such a Light, as may throughly satisfy, or at least effectually silence the Doubtful and Exceptious?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "395a08ec-eb03-4a0f-ba90-13b8238e1a03",
                                "sense_id": "c7a6eb0c-9db4-31ba-ab41-04cf1260181a",
                                "text": "The company, who were not at all exceptious, seemed extremely well pleased with every particular of the entertainment […]."
